*** book.py
```python
class Book:
    def __init__(self, title: str, author: str, summary: str):
        self.title = title
        self.author = author
        self.summary = summary

    def get_details(self) -> dict:
        return {
            'title': self.title,
            'author': self.author,
            'summary': self.summary
        }
```

*** reading_list.py
```python
class ReadingList:
    def __init__(self, user):
        self.user = user
        self.books = []

    def add_book(self, book):
        self.books.append(book)

    def get_books(self):
        return self.books
```

